<details class="docs-disclosure"><summary>Request prerequisites and retry rules</summary><ol class="docs-steps"><li>Resolve opaque project/folder IDs from the catalog and check the credential’s scope.</li><li>Compute SHA-256, MIME type, bytes, dimensions and duration. Prepare a real JPEG preview.</li><li>Begin with a persisted idempotency key. Send storage requests without the Review bearer header. Complete the same session.</li><li>For video, poll the job until Ready or Failed. Transfer completion is not proof of review readiness.</li><li>Read media and metadata by pinned version ID. Do not keep or log signed URLs as permanent references.</li></ol><p>A changed request body needs a new key. An uncertain response needs replay of the same recorded operation, not another upload.</p></details>
